Pytaichenko wake word features

The audio features in this component are a port of the TensorFlow Lite Micro
microfrontend (tensorflow/lite/experimental/microfrontend/lib: window, fft,
filterbank, noise_reduction, pcan_gain_control, log_scale and log_lut).

